  n2* (largest n with mu_2/7(AP_n) >= m_P) = 37
  => COMPOSITE (C2 + subset lemma, proved modulo roof): every 13-set with SOME
     leave-one-out of primitive diameter <= 36 has mu_1/7 >= m_P --
     covers '12 tame + one arbitrarily far element' (outside kps-S59's D<=75 zone).

